This guide is part of the [Drizzle](/drizzle) stack docs.

Just like the [personal dashboard](../personal-accounts/dashboard), the organization dashboard is a placeholder/skeleton for your organization's dashboard.

This is the same exact path and file, but you can switch the content displayed based on the active context (personal or organization).

It's the main page that users will see when they access their organization's dashboard. It's up to you to build the content of this page - be it a dashboard, a project overview, a team overview, etc.

- **Route:** `/dashboard`
- **Location:** `apps/web/app/[locale]/(internal)/dashboard/page.tsx`

**Note:** Organizations share the same route as personal accounts. The active account (personal or organization) is determined by application state/context, not URL slugs.

